---
// Hero.astro
---

<header class="hero-section animate-fade-up">
  <div class="status-pill-wrapper">
    <div class="badge">
      <span class="badge-dot"></span>
      <span>持续探索与构建中 · Edge & Automation</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="avatar-container">
    <div class="avatar-glow"></div>
    <div class="avatar-inner" aria-label="b1000mk 头像">
      <span class="avatar-letter">B</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1 class="hero-name">
    <span class="gradient-text">b1000mk</span>
  </h1>

  <p class="hero-tagline">
    “路漫漫其修远，吾将上下而求索”
  </p>

  <p class="hero-bio">
    专注于边缘计算、Cloudflare 全球网络、自动化流程与极简高美感 Web 界面设计。
  </p>

  <div class="hero-cta-group">
    <a href="#projects" class="btn-primary">
      <span>浏览作品</span>
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
        <polyline points="19 12 12 19 5 12"></polyline>
      </svg>
    </a>
    
    <a href="https://github.com/b1000mk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-secondary">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
        <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.53 1.032 1.53 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"></path>
      </svg>
      <span>GitHub 主页</span>
    </a>

    <button id="quick-copy-btn" class="btn-secondary copy-btn" type="button" data-text="https://github.com/b1000mk" title="复制主页链接">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
        <path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path>
      </svg>
      <span>分享名片</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 0 48px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .status-pill-wrapper {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .avatar-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 108px;
    height: 108px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .avatar-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gradient-accent);
    opacity: 0.45;
    filter: blur(14px);
    transition: all 0.4s ease;
  }

  .avatar-container:hover .avatar-glow {
    opacity: 0.8;
    filter: blur(20px);
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }

  .avatar-inner {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1e293b, #0f172a);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  :root:not([data-theme="dark"]) .avatar-inner {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0f172a, #1e293b);
  }

  .avatar-container:hover .avatar-inner {
    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.04);
  }

  .avatar-letter {
    font-size: 50px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    user-select: none;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .hero-name {
    font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 22px);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .hero-bio {
    max-width: 520px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
  }

  .hero-cta-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .copy-btn {
    border: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero-section {
      padding: 40px 0 36px;
    }
    .hero-cta-group {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .hero-cta-group > * {
      flex: 1 1 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
